# Phase 3.2b. `make embed` writes summary.json here (counts + stamps ONLY — never a
# vector: embeddings are not guaranteed byte-reproducible across model-server
# versions, unlike the deterministic baseline/dedup artifacts).
#
# This file exists so the directory is TRACKED. docker-compose binds
# `./docs/embeddings:/committed`, and Docker creates a missing bind source as a
# ROOT-OWNED directory on the host — which then fights every later write.
